        <p>"THE BEST REMEDY OF THE AGE." At this season of the year no one should be without GWILYM EVANS' QUININE MITERS. A course taken Now will be available in giving tone to the system, stew life to the blood, and in bracing the nerves. CAUTION.—Ask plainly for •GWILYM EVANS' QUININE urrEßs, and -see that the name GWILYN EVANS is on label, stamp and bottle. Sold by all chemists, in is. id., 23. 9d., and 4s. 6d. bottles, or direct from the proprietors, carriage free by parcels post for the above ptices. QUININE BITTERS MANUFACTURING CO.</p>
