k Currants 0 0-0 0 Soles ~1 2 o 0 Red Currants 0 0— 0 0 Sparlings Marrows each 0 0-0 4 Codfish ~ 0 Seakale t It. o'o 0 0 Macaerel each 0 5 - 0 • Rhubarb bch 0 1,-0 0 tterring dozen 1 6</p>
